<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 562.98, up 1.56.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 262 to 240.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.03.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 19,343,250 compared with 16,337,265 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
